# Package F "Proxy Vote": Carleton hires you. Flags: JobAccepted(proxy_vote), proxy_vote_paid, proxy_vote_bribed.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('proxy_vote_paid')
goto: Done

cond: HasFlag('proxy_vote_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(proxy_vote)') && HasItem('proxy_vote')
goto: Return

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(proxy_vote)')
goto: Waiting

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: BAT is buying Liverpool Filtration, quietly. The board votes Monday. One small shareholder is in the way: old Hal, south district. Fifteen shares, and he's sentimental.
#
o_text: You want his vote.
o_id: proxy_vote_accept
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: Not my kind of job.
o_id: proxy_vote_decline
o_goto: Bye

name: Accepted
npc: His signed proxy. He keeps it in a strongbox, he keeps the key on him. Six hundred. How you persuade him is your career path, not mine.
effect: SetFlag('JobAccepted(proxy_vote)')
effect: EndConversation

name: Waiting
npc: Old Hal. South district. A signature. This is how the top is reached.
effect: EndConversation

name: Return
npc: (He checks the signature against a file.) Hal's own hand. Lovely.
#
o_text: (Hand it over.) 600 sat, as agreed.
o_id: proxy_vote_give
o_goto: Paid
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: proxy_vote_keep
o_goto: Bye

name: Paid
npc: Six hundred. Monday morning, Liverpool Filtration belongs to BAT and the dome's water belongs to us. You're welcome in this building any time.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'proxy_vote', 1)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 600)
effect: SetFlag('proxy_vote_paid')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: The vote failed. By fifteen shares. (His smile stays perfect.) I'll remember your face.
effect: EndConversation

name: Done
npc: Busy. Always busy.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: My card. Don't call it.
effect: EndConversation
